# Records docs/demo.gif. Regenerate with: vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 430
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "./scripts/demo.sh"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 16s
